mgcv-fortran is a modern Fortran port of selected computational portions of
mgcv 1.9-4 by Simon N. Wood and contributors.

Original package:
  Package: mgcv
  Version: 1.9-4
  License: GPL (>= 2)

The local splines dependency is a modern Fortran translation of the R splines
package and is licensed GPL-2.0-or-later.

This is an independent language port. It is not maintained or endorsed by the
original mgcv author or the R Core Team. The original source files are retained
in original/ for license traceability. The Fortran implementation does not
claim complete behavioral compatibility with R mgcv; see docs/API_MAP.md and
docs/PORTING_NOTES.md.
